graph TD
    JD[Parsed Job Description] --> KE[Keyword Extractor]
    KE --> SM[Skill Matcher]
    CS[Candidate Skills] --> SM
    
    SM --> PR[Prompt Builder]
    JD --> PR
    CS --> PR
    
    CS --> RAG[RAG Retriever]
    JD --> RAG
    RAG --> PR
    
    PR --> LLM[LLM Provider]
    LLM --> VAL[Output Validator]
    
    VAL -- Fails (max 2 retries) --> LLM
    VAL -- Success --> JSON[Final JSON Output]
